e_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 50.4886%;\">GH Post Stimulation 120 Minutes 12:00 Pm</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 32.9767%;\">&lt; 0.02 ng/mL</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 16.5079%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
